    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d99">

                <pb facs="0100" n="778" sameAs="frus:frus1863p2/pg778"/>

                <head>Mr. Dayton to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 350.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-09-24"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >September</hi> 24, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> Herewith I have the honor to enclose to
                    your department the copy of a communication made by me to Mr. Drouyn de l’Huys
                    on the 22d instant, in reference to the ships now being built and the arms,
                    projectiles, &amp;c., now being made at Bordeaux and Nantes for the rebels of
                    the south.</p>
                <p>The evidence has been heretofore sent to your department.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM L. DAYTON.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William</hi> H. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Seward, Secretary of State, &amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d99-a1.xml" xpointer="d99-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
